  "final": "The suite passes now (7 tests, OK).\n\nAll 183 failures were one bug. `reorder_qty` in `inventory/stock.py` computed `packs = need // pack_size`, which rounds down. An order for 197 units with 12-unit packs came out as 192, short of the need. I changed it to round up: `packs = -(-need // pack_size)`.\n\nThe huge output was mostly `[trace]` lines from `logutil`, plus one failure block per `subTest`. I didn't touch the logging.",
